WEBVTT

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.310
Everything in this world
is dreamed by the goddess, Eve!

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:14.860
We are all visions created by her dream!

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.740
Then, what are we?

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.870
Where are our true selves?

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:26.250
People, do not grieve the maidens who have
fallen ill with the Sleeping Beauty Syndrome!

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:30.750
Those maidens have awakened
to their true selves in their dreams

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.310
and have been blessed by Eve!

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.050
That's right!

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:39.100
They have taken their true forms
in their dreams and have been freed!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:44.020
Behaving like witches, they are
more beautiful than anyone else!

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:48.020
Oh? There's actually someone
taking him seriously.

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:33.980
<i>ENTER THE RED DOORS</i>

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:54.590
<i>Up above the forest of slumber</i>

00:01:54.590 --> 00:02:01.220
<i>Two moons look down from the sky</i>

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:08.730
<i>Where did you come from,</i>
<i>and where are you going?</i>

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:17.110
<i>Where are we going?</i>

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:22.780
<i>ENTER THE RED DOORS</i>

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:32.250
"The Thorn Cross Association"

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:32.250
I found a clue!

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:33.500
Huh?

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.010
A clue about Yurina in the dream world!

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:39.680
More importantly, why am I
the only one who can't wake up?

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:40.760
Huh?

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:42.780
All the witches have woken up.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.940
I'm checking on that.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:03:00.360
The girls with Sleeping Beauty Syndrome
have all returned to the real world.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:03.410
Well, with one exception, anyway.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:04.870
An exception?

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.620
One of the girls passed away.

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:10.590
The Witch of First Love, Kayo Sugisaki.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:12.530
Oh, right...

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.090
No, but what about me?!

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:24.390
I'm trying to tell you that
the discovery about Yurina

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.310
will also be a key to solving
the mystery about you!

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:29.020
Not only that, but also to the mystery of Lily!

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:31.350
I don't care about that stuff!

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:34.360
What do you mean, you don't care?

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:37.520
I suspect that everything is connected!

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:40.150
In the end, all you care about is yourself!

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:44.990
As long as you can save your sister,
you don't care what happens to me, right?

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:46.370
How rude.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.390
Apologize for what you just said.

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.370
No way.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.160
What I want are answers!

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.880
At the very least,
I am more mature than you.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:57.540
So what?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:03.130
I have concluded that there is no point
in continuing this unproductive back-and-forth.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.550
Are you going to look for your sister?

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.540
Did you say something about a clue?

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:10.310
What?

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:13.100
I don't feel like talking anymore.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:15.310
Hey!

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.500
I want this dream to end!

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:02.070
I am a representative of the
Thorn Cross Association, Ehyeh.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:10.900
Professor Kanzaki, I am honored to meet
such a famous researcher of the dream world.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:14.830
Brother!

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.710
Oh, it's you.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:19.000
You got in a fight with that professor, huh?

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.710
How do you know?

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.170
'Cause it's a dream.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:24.110
I don't want to dream anymore.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:28.220
Do you want to know why you're
the only one who won't wake up?

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:30.330
Do you know?

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:34.140
I know why you won't wake up:

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.100
because I'm the one keeping you asleep.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:43.980
Oh? Even the renowned
Professor Kanzaki does not know Eve?

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:46.230
I'm afraid not...

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:50.570
Actually, my younger sister
also has Sleeping Beauty Syndrome,

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.490
and I was wondering if that was related...

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:54.330
That is wonderful!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:59.040
Your sister is receiving the blessing
of Eve in the dream world.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:04.170
Hey, what do you want from me?

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:06.760
Something that only you can do.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:11.640
Because I think you're the only one
who can stop Eve from waking up.

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.760
Eve? What's Eve?

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:16.810
Eve's Eve. From Adam and Eve.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.320
If Eve wakes up...

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.070
...then everyone will die.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:44.380
That is the salvation of mankind.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:49.630
What we in the Thorn Cross
Association worship

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:54.640
is the goddess, Eve, who sleeps
in the center of the dream world.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:59.180
An awesome being who is also the
beginning of this world and of mankind.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:03.770
You said that this whole world
is a dream that Eve is dreaming, right?

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.900
I don't really understand that part...

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:10.280
You know the story of
Adam and Eve, do you not?

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:14.910
The first man and woman who received
the blessings of God in the Garden of Eden.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:18.940
However, they were tricked by the devil
to eat fruit from the Tree of Knowledge,

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:22.500
angering God and getting
thrown out of Eden.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.290
Yes, I know that much.

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:28.880
After much lamentation, Eve was
so tormented by her own actions

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:33.780
that she closed off her heart
and fell into a deep sleep.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:40.180
In the dreams brought on by her sleep
is this world in which we live.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:45.690
If we study history, we can see that
the reality is far from the paradise of Eden.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:49.690
People suffer from one illness after another,

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:51.700
the gap between the rich
and poor grows wider,

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:54.530
and there is no end to war and conflicts.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:56.830
People are only becoming more depraved.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:08:01.500
Because they ate fruit
from the Tree of Knowledge,

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.290
mankind angered God and
are receiving eternal punishment.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.840
That is Eve's dream.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:10.090
It is the "now" that we call reality.

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:13.090
Then, what are we?

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:15.760
This is a temporary form.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.100
Inside dreams is where reality lies.

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:21.380
Then, that's my reality?

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:27.980
Awakening to our dream selves
is the salvation we seek.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:32.030
The key to that lies in the witches
who built the dream world.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:34.030
In the witches?

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:39.660
Eve fell asleep and made
this world of suffering.

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:43.040
But what of the maidens with
Sleeping Beauty Syndrome?

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:48.250
Yes, they built a dream world of only witches.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:52.090
In that world, everything
they desired came true...

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:54.220
A wonderful world.

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:57.510
It is the true Garden of Eden.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:12.110
And if Eve awakens,

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:15.860
then we will be freed from
Eve's world of suffering,

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:17.950
with no war or poverty--

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.700
only an eternal paradise.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:24.080
Then, does that mean the
witches should not wake up?

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:28.080
They've awakened to their true selves
before everyone else, right?

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.710
Exactly.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:32.130
And there is someone keeping
them from their true selves,

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:34.010
bringing them back to this world...

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:37.380
Someone evil.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:45.600
All the witches you've saved up until now

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:50.020
were linchpins that opened up
the path to Eve's door.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.650
Linchpins? Those girls were?

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.960
Yes. Remember.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.450
Game set.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:59.410
Oh, I feel much better.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:02.280
Who's the strongest in this world?

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.000
The Witch of Thunder!

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.000
What "dream world" is this?

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.580
You're just being self-complacent.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:13.800
It's super tiring to be the girl
everyone wants me to be.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.880
I can't fail.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.680
But I really want to be spoiled.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.050
But I can't!

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:22.760
That's why I had no choice
but to bind myself!

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:26.590
I can do what I want in
this world at least, right?!

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.650
It was my dream to do this.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:36.920
That dream's over once you
kill all three of them, though.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:38.900
Your dream will end.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.300
What'll you do after that?

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:44.370
If I don't kill them, I can't live.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:45.870
Why is it always me...?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.210
Why...?!

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:53.380
When I eat, I lose weight in a hurry.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.970
And losing weight is a bad thing?

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.550
Yes, it is.

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:01.870
When I ate and lost weight,
my boyfriend dumped me.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:07.020
Going to school, studying,
playing with friends...

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:08.560
...finding lots of love...

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:15.020
Being able to enjoy this moment...
just like everyone else--

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.570
that's all I want, and yet...

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:20.740
Weren't involved?! They're still guilty!

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:24.950
It's gutless to know that bullying
is going on, and pretend not to see it!

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.700
Did you forget?

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:31.620
Pot... was killed by me...

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.330
I will never forget that!

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:35.290
There's no way I could forget!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:52.310
It's not as though everyone
leads the same life as you do.

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:57.570
But if you realize that even
a little bit, I'd be glad.

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:00.690
By learning the slightest bit about someone...

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:03.490
...by changing your point of view just a bit...

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:07.080
...your feelings toward that person
suddenly grow a lot closer.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.290
Getting to know them;

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:12.580
listening for their voice...

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.670
Misaki is an eternal idol!

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:21.760
A national star that everyone admires!

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:24.090
She doesn't fall in love
or go to the bathroom.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:26.260
She's a perfect idol!

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:33.110
A perfect idol. Is there
really anyone like that?

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:38.390
Come on, Jane. It's okay.
You don't have to be afraid.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:43.110
This is where I draw you close, Haruto.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:49.190
Jane, you can't stay in a dream like this.

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:52.930
Wake up, Jane.

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:54.670
I know you can do it.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:56.600
Let's go, together with me.

00:12:57.590 --> 00:12:59.910
Come on, summon your courage.

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:03.590
What does a made-up world
like this have for you?

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.490
Open your eyes and start walking, Jane.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:11.310
Don't give up, Jane!
I know you can do it, Jane!

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:18.480
Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane!
Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane!

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.650
Aw, man!

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.440
Well, rather than witches,

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.540
they just seemed like they each
had their own issues to deal with.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.450
There are many witches,

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:32.660
but not even I knew which
witches had become linchpins.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:38.290
But for you, the witches were
the ones who contacted you, right?

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:41.250
That's how we knew who were linchpins.

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:48.970
Why me?

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:50.260
Because you're you.

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.140
That doesn't explain anything.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:57.310
When those ten linchpins are removed,
the door to Eve opens.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:59.850
Brother, come with me to that door.

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:01.150
What'll we do once we get there?

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:03.730
I want you to stop Eve from waking up.

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:05.150
Stop her?

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:07.400
Kill her.

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.530
You want <i>me</i> to kill her? Why?

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.120
Why don't you do it?

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.800
You're the one who wants to kill her.

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:14.830
I can't do it!

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:15.660
Why not?

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.080
You saw it, didn't you?

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:20.290
The world will end.
All of mankind will die.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.460
That doesn't answer my question!

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:25.920
Professor, you know who the evil one is.

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.550
Inside dreams I do.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:30.080
I wish for you to stop him.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:35.560
The evil one has already
awoken ten witches.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:39.500
Let's open your eyes.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:56.260
I wish I could've met you sooner...

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:07.530
I have a new dream now...

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:10.770
Thank you.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.060
Hey, Haruto.

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:26.190
I was <i>really</i>...

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:28.840
...happy.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:42.480
I...

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:45.060
...love you...

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.460
...Haruto!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:28.500
That's so good! And so fun!

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:43.360
Des... tiny...?

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:48.320
The one place where you
can really be yourself is...

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:54.030
Yes. Ultimately, this is the
only path I have, isn't it?

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:04.540
That's right, Mirei. You shine brightest
when you're on the ice.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:09.630
So keep right on skating. That's what your...

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.490
...destiny is.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:30.770
It's all right. Knowing you,
you'll be able to overcome this.

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.670
Then, does that mean I'm alive?

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:40.280
I can get out of here, then?

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.580
That part depends on you.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:48.290
On whether you're ready to face
living in your harsh reality.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.290
I <i>am</i> ready.

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:54.550
Thank you.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.180
Farewell.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.600
I'm glad I...

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.790
I'm glad I met you!

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:16.240
I'll see you later!

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:19.490
Huh?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:33.880
Now, the spell's about to be broken, Princess.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:45.390
He gave me a chance.

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:48.690
Then that means I can see you on the outside?

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:51.610
Um, will you be my friend?

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:52.730
Of course.

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:57.560
I want to see you...

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:09.210
All of that has angered Eve.

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:11.170
Why did he awaken them?

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:13.500
Why did he tamper with their feelings?

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:17.880
Eve is trying to wake up
because of her anger.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:23.050
Then, Eve is waking up from anger
and then trying to save mankind?

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:28.930
We wish for that awakening to occur,
not from anger, but from love.

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:32.940
Love is another ambiguous word...

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:35.320
If Eve awakens from love,

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:38.360
then she would likely forgive this world
of the fruit of the Tree of Knowledge.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:42.950
That is the only way to escape
the punishment of the gods.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:48.120
By the way, if Eve wakes up
and saves the world,

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.460
then what kind of world awaits us?

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:53.700
The world will become Sleeping Beauty.

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:05.830
I don't really get it,
but it seems pretty scary.

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:17.420
Don't believe them.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:22.660
Who are you?

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:25.370
Someone who hates the Thorn Cross Association.

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:26.580
That's all.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:28.950
Do you know something?

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:30.750
Do I look like I do?

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:33.370
Why did you talk to me, then?

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.000
What? I'm just warning you.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.880
So you won't fall for what those fools say.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:42.130
You're not being very clear.
What are you hiding?

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:45.890
Nothing. I said I hate those guys, right?

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:49.140
Anyway, don't get near those guys anymore.

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.240
You want to live a long time, don't you?

00:20:57.650 --> 00:20:59.440
What a weirdo.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:07.030
Yes? Professor, it's been a long time.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:10.410
It's been a while. There's
something I want to ask you.

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:13.500
Ask me? What is it?

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.330
It's about Haruto.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:18.920
Not just you. I want to ask
all the other witches, too.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.320
About Haruto?

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:25.630
Then, there's a lot that we
would like to tell you, as well.

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:27.680
Hm? "We"?

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:31.640
Yes, all of us former witches.

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:41.690
If I open this, then I'll be at the door
that'll lead me to Eve, right?

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:43.110
Yes.

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:44.820
I guess I have no choice, then.

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:46.280
Shall we go?

00:21:59.590 --> 00:22:04.670
I am a representative of the
Thorn Cross Association, Ehyeh.

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:09.550
Everything in this world
is dreamed by the goddess, Eve!

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:15.270
We are all visions created by her dream!

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:19.230
Then, what are we?

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:23.400
Where are our true selves?

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:30.160
People, do not grieve the maidens who have
fallen ill with the Sleeping Beauty Syndrome!

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:36.790
Those maidens have awakened
to their true selves in their dreams

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:40.420
and have been blessed by Eve!

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:47.630
That's right! They have taken their true forms
in their dreams and have been freed!

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:23.960
Awaken.

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:30.680
The witch's singing voice rings out.

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:32.550
Turn your ear toward it.

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:34.390
Listen to her feelings.

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:41.400
"The Witch Wars"

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:36.460
Listen, baa!

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:39.280
Next time's dream is "The Witch Wars."
